# Titania's Song's continuous effect still applies to noncreature artifacts entering after the Song leaves, until cleanup.
# Sol Ring remains a 1/1 without its mana ability after Disenchant destroys the Song (CR 611.3a, 613.6, 514.2).
# Mind Stone, under Bot1's control since an earlier turn (so its {T} ability is not barred by CR 302.6), is a 2/2 that
# has lost its mana ability, while the Song is on the battlefield and after it leaves (CR 613.1f, 613.4b, 202.3).
# The Sol Ring cast after the Song left would exist on the battlefield as an artifact creature, so Bot2's Authority of the
# Consuls has it enter tapped, and its "a creature enters" trigger gains Bot2 1 life (CR 614.12, 603.6a); Mind Stone,
# cast before the Song when it was no creature, entered untapped.
